# CBD/cisplatin combination vs DMSO - DE + Enrichr-ready deliverables

**Question asked:** odds ratio for "p53-mediated cell cycle gene regulation" in a gseapy
Enrichr / `Reactome_2022` enrichment on all statistically DE genes (p<0.05, |LFC|>0.5,
baseMean>10) between the CBD/cisplatin combination and DMSO.

**Status: DE complete; the Enrichr step is BLOCKED. No odds ratio is reported, because a locally
recomputed Fisher OR is not an acceptable substitute.**

The "network unreachable" claim was verified rather than assumed (`analysis/RETRY_LOG.txt`, 48 logged
attempts with exact commands and full stderr; summary in `analysis/ENRICHR_BLOCKER.txt`):
no default route (`ip route` empty, `lo` only) and no `/etc/resolv.conf` (nor `/etc/hosts`) -> every
hostname gives `[Errno -3] Temporary failure in name resolution`, every raw TCP connect to a public
IPv4/IPv6 address gives `[Errno 101] Network is unreachable`; no proxy/index is configured anywhere
(`env`, `pip config list -v`, no `/etc/pip.conf`, no `~/.netrc`) and local proxy ports 3128/8888/8080/
1080/8118 refuse connections; `pip install gseapy` fails on PyPI and on the Tsinghua/Aliyun/Tencent/
HuaweiCloud mirrors; pip cache empty; `find /` finds no gseapy/pydeseq2/wheel/.gmt/Reactome file; no
conda/mamba/uv/R. Enrichr endpoints retried at write time: `/datasetStatistics`, `/descriptor`,
`/geneSetLibrary?...Reactome_2022`, `static/gene_sets/Reactome_2022.txt`, plus pypi, GitHub, reactome.org
and conda-forge - all `[Errno -3]`.

## Query/background fraction (for interpreting the eventual OR)
The Enrichr query is **1,680 symbols = 5.7% of the 29,540 testable genes** in this contrast (2.6% of the
63,677 matrix rows). `gseapy.enrich(..., background=None)` uses Enrichr's default whole-library universe,
not our expressed subset, so a query covering ~6% of the transcriptome sits in a background that already
contains much of every pathway's membership: odds ratios for even a genuine, broad transcriptional
response are expected to be modest (roughly 1.1-2 for top terms), not the 5-20 typical of small targeted
queries. Read the OR together with P-value, adjusted P-value and Overlap in the result table.
The conservative t(df=4) query is 1,116 symbols (from 1,167 DE genes).

